      "message": "I think the cps8100_init should be called before we can handle any event but i would defer to Daisuke to see if this is reasonable.\n\nFrom the code, it looks like the pchg_startup() will be called, right? Could we put the probe to the cps8100_reset() if the cps8100_init is not the first called function?",
